WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.582 --> 00:00:10.772
Sign in as the platform admin.

2
00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:17.448
Settings has its own menu, grouped into General, Sign-up and billing, Messaging, and Security and system.

3
00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:23.959
Platform holds the name shown in the panel and in emails, plus your support email and company details.

4
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:31.132
Scroll down to upload the logo for the light and dark themes. A wide PNG with a transparent background works best.

5
00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:37.097
Appearance sets the accent colour, the default theme and the font for the whole admin panel.

6
00:00:37.197 --> 00:00:43.334
Pick a colour and the panel previews it at once. Nothing changes for others until you press Save.

7
00:00:43.435 --> 00:00:49.845
New business defaults are the starting values every new business gets, the currency and the time zone.

8
00:00:49.945 --> 00:00:55.916
Sign-up decides who can register. You can close sign-ups, or require a verified email address.

9
00:00:56.016 --> 00:01:02.593
Block email domains, and limit how many invitations a business or a person can send per hour and per day.

10
00:01:02.694 --> 00:01:09.104
System email is the mail server used for verification, password reset, invitations and billing emails.

11
00:01:09.204 --> 00:01:14.240
Email templates lets you edit the wording of each message the platform sends.

12
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:20.696
Security sets the admin idle timeout, the shop session lifetime, password length and sign-in lockout.

13
00:01:20.796 --> 00:01:27.097
You can also require two-factor authentication for every admin. We leave these settings as they are.

14
00:01:27.197 --> 00:01:32.564
That is Settings. Legal pages, languages, backups and updates are in the same menu.
